sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Browser as Web browser
participant NotificationsController
participant StreamController as NotificationStreamController
participant RabbitMQ
participant Consumer as RabbitMqClimateAlertConsumerAdapter
participant NotificationService
participant ProfileRepository as MongoNotificationProfileRepository
participant InAppAdapter as InAppAlertNotifierAdapter
participant NotificationRepository as MongoNotificationRepository
participant Events as EventEmitter2

Browser->>NotificationsController: GET /notifications?unreadOnly=true&limit=20
NotificationsController->>NotificationRepository: findByUserId(userId, unreadOnly)
NotificationRepository-->>Browser: unread notification history
Browser->>StreamController: GET /notifications/stream?token=JWT
StreamController->>StreamController: validate JWT and subscribe userId

RabbitMQ->>Consumer: ClimateAlertDetectedMessage
Consumer->>NotificationService: handleClimateAlert(message)
NotificationService->>ProfileRepository: findSubscribersByStationId(stationId)
ProfileRepository-->>NotificationService: subscribed profiles
NotificationService->>NotificationService: resolve in-app targets when deliveryChannels.inApp is true
NotificationService->>InAppAdapter: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
InAppAdapter->>NotificationRepository: save(Notification)
NotificationRepository-->>InAppAdapter: duplicate messageId is idempotent
InAppAdapter->>Events: emit notification.delivered(userId, notification)
Events-->>StreamController: matching user event
StreamController-->>Browser: event: notification
StreamController-->>Browser: event: ping every 25s
